WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

1. Images. The photographs and diagrams in assets/img/ are third-party works.
   Each is credited on credits.html with its host and its own terms (public
   domain, CC BY, CC BY-SA, or fair quotation). Reuse an image only under the
   licence named beside it on that page, never under CC BY-NC 4.0.

2. The claims themselves. Quotations from books, papers, articles and court
   records remain the property of their authors and are reproduced for study,
   criticism and review, with attribution. Removing the attribution is not a
   use this licence permits.

3. Third-party names and marks. Any product, institution or publication named
   in the archive remains the trademark of its owner.

